<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;">Hi <%= @user.first_name.presence || "there" %>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;color:#334155;">The <%= @plan.name %> trial for <%= @business.name %> ends on <strong><%= @business.trial_ends_at.in_time_zone(@business.time_zone).to_date.to_fs(:long) %></strong>. To keep <%= @plan.name %>, choose a plan in Settings → Plan. Otherwise you'll move to <%= Plan.default!.name %>: nothing is deleted, and anything beyond its limits becomes read-only.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:14px;"><a href="<%= admin_plan_url %>" style="color:#047857;font-weight:600;">See plans</a></p>
